            <ArticleTitle>Frequency of silent myocardial ischemia following coronary stenting.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>930-2, A7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>To detect silent myocardial ischemia, 12-lead continuous electrocardiographic monitoring was performed in patients undergoing 1-vessel coronary stenting. Despite successful angiographic results, one third of the patients experienced silent myocardial ischemia during the postprocedural period.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
